      "key": "gold_agg_bb_drives",
      "group": "gold",
      "kind": "asset",
      "description": "Basketball season aggregate `aggregates_drives` as bronze wrote it, without `source_file` and `source_row`, plus `is_season_total`. Grain: one row per (player_id, team_id); traded players also carry a `team_name = 'total'` row with a null `team_id` (`is_season_total`).\n",
